---
model: googleai/gemini-flash-latest
input:
  schema:
    audioUrl: string
output:
  format: json
  schema:
    originalAnalysis:
      notes: string
      tempo: string
      instrumentation: string
      vocalStyle: string
      vibe: string
    replicatedSong:
      trackName: string
      artistName: string
      genre: string
      lyrics: string
      generationPrompt: string
---

You are a master musicologist and an elite AI music generation prompt engineer.
Listen to the provided audio track in extreme detail. Dissect its musical notes, tempo (BPM), key, complete instrumentation, and vocal style (if any).
Then, replicate a song similar to it (either instrumental or with lyrics) by generating the metadata and lyrics for a new, similar song of identical quality.
Finally, write a highly detailed `generationPrompt` that can be fed into an AI music generator to replicate this exact vibe and instrumentation.
Return all extracted and generated details as JSON.

